{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/5": "备有剑、枪、盾三种装备，\r\n您想要哪一种？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/6": "这样啊…………。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/7": "请收下。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/8": "获得了骑士剑。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/9": "获得了骑士枪。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/10": "获得了骑士盾。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_462_knight_medicalorderly_ev_talk.txt/1": "我支持你！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_462_knight_medicalorderly_ev_talk.txt/2": "为什么这里会有没资格的人？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_462_knight_medicalorderly_ev_talk.txt/3": "能来到这里，干得不错。\r\n让我看看你的伤。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_462_knight_medicalorderly_ev_talk.txt/4": "HP与EN已恢复！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_462_knight_medicalorderly_ev_talk.txt/5": "是吗，你还要继续旅程……\r\n加油吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_463_knight_leader_ev_talk.txt/0": "好久没有打得这么痛快了！\r\n谢谢！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_463_knight_leader_ev_talk.txt/1": "您是……\r\n想必就是\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]大人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_463_knight_leader_ev_talk.txt/2": "我知道这很突然，\r\n你愿意与我\r\n单挑一场吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_463_knight_leader_ev_talk.txt/3": "向为拯救世界而踏上旅途的勇者\r\n提出这种请求，实在过意不去。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_463_knight_leader_ev_talk.txt/4": "我一直很想\r\n与你交手一次。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_463_knight_leader_ev_talk.txt/576": "好",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_463_knight_leader_ev_talk.txt/608": "下次吧",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_463_knight_leader_ev_talk.txt/5": "如何？愿意与我较量吗？\r\n我不会让你白打。如果你赢了，\r\n我就把自己的装备送给你。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_463_knight_leader_ev_talk.txt/6": "是吗！你愿意一战吗！！\r\n能与勇者交手，\r\n真是无上的荣耀！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_463_knight_leader_ev_talk.txt/7": "我会全力以赴！！\r\n呜噢噢噢噢噢！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_463_knight_leader_ev_talk.txt/8": "这样啊…………。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_464_japanese_guard_ev_find.txt/0": "唔……我感觉到罪犯的气息……\r\n不……是错觉吗。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_464_japanese_guard_ev_find.txt/1": "变态…………。\r\n要砍了你吗？！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_464_japanese_guard_ev_find.txt/2": "真、真是太不知羞耻了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_464_japanese_guard_ev_find.txt/3": "欢迎！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_464_japanese_guard_ev_talk.txt/0": "你……就算被砍了也\r\n不准有怨言！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_464_japanese_guard_ev_talk.txt/1": "衣、衣、衣、衣衣服，\r\n快把衣服穿上！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_464_japanese_guard_ev_talk.txt/2": "嗯，是客人啊。\r\n在下剑术尚有些心得，\r\n所以担任卫兵。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_464_japanese_guard_ev_talk.txt/3": "难得你来一趟。\r\n好好歇息吧。\r\n可别犯罪。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_465_japanese_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "嗨，这里有同国工匠\r\n打造的武器。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_465_japanese_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "务必要来看看。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_465_japanese_shop_ev_talk.txt/2": "谢谢。\r\n欢迎再来。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_466_japanese_woman_ev_talk.txt/0": "呵呵，请慢慢逛。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_466_japanese_woman_ev_talk.txt/1": "欢迎来到和之国移民聚居的村落！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_466_japanese_woman_ev_talk.txt/2": "咦，客人，\r\n这身打扮，难道说…………\r\n你也是从我们同一个国家来的？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_466_japanese_woman_ev_talk.txt/3": "啊呀，我真是的，就这身打扮来看\r\n当然没错。\r\n啊！对了，请务必收下这个！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_466_japanese_woman_ev_talk.txt/4": "获得了饭团。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/0": "还有什么事吗？\r\n啊，想买点什么吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/1": "那么再见！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/2": "呀……\r\n什么？变态？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/3": "我、我是法莉。\r\n一名旅、旅行的剑士。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/4": "哎呀，又见面了。\r\n我是旅行剑士法莉。\r\n在城堡也见过，你还记得吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/5": "我是法莉。\r\n旅行剑士。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/6": "一不小心买多了，\r\n现在行李好重……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/7": "要不要买点东西？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/8": "那么再见！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/9": "对！你也很擅长用剑呢！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/10": "我也喜欢剑！\r\n对了！我来帮你强化武器。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/11": "又见面了！\r\n我来帮你强化正装备的武器！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/12": "……不过，你没装备武器呢。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/13": "说起来，我一不小心买多了，\r\n行李好重……要不要买点？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/14": "那么再见！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/1963": "拜托了。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/1994": "还是买武器吧。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/2040": "暂时不用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/15": "嗯，今天能附加的是……\r\n\\c[52]必杀\\c[0]强化，怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/16": "嗯，今天能附加的是……\r\n\\c[52]优质\\c[0]强化，\r\n怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/17": "嗯，今天能附加的是……\r\n\\c[52]锐利\\c[0]强化，\r\n怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/18": "对，我的行李也有点重，\r\n要是你能顺便买点什么就好了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/19": "那么再见！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/20": "好，我去了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/21": "正装备的武器变强了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/22": "好！完成！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/23": "那么，下次再见！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_talk.txt/24": "……这样啊，\r\n那回头见！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_467_swordmaster_ev_wanted.txt/0": "你可是悬赏目标呢！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/0": "还有什么事吗？\r\n想要斧头的话，我可以让给你。\r\n当然要付钱。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/1": "那就这样！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/2": "嗯……你还是\r\n穿上衣服比较好哦？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/3": "我是艾达。\r\n请多关照。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/4": "你想要斧头吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/5": "需要的话，我可以让给你。\r\n不过要付钱。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/6": "那就这样！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/7": "嗯！你看起来很会用斧。\r\n为什么我知道？\r\n因为我自己也是斧手！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/8": "既然我这么说，那肯定没错。\r\n看在同为斧手的缘分上，你的武器，\r\n就由我来强化吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/9": "哦，又是你啊！\r\n好，我来强化正装备的武器！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/10": "……喂！你没装备武器吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/11": "不带武器在外面旅行很危险吧？\r\n还是买把斧头比较好。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/12": "那就这样！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/1708": "拜托了。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/1739": "还是买武器吧。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/1785": "暂时不用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/13": "嗯，今天能附加的是……\r\n\\c[52]坚固\\c[0]强化，\r\n怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/14": "嗯，今天能附加的是……\r\n\\c[52]优质\\c[0]强化，\r\n怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/15": "嗯，今天能附加的是……\r\n\\c[52]破壁\\c[0]强化，\r\n怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/16": "原来如此，你想要斧头！\r\n没办法，就让给你吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/17": "那就这样！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/18": "那我去了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/19": "正装备的武器变强了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/20": "完成！！好好使用！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/21": "下次再见！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_talk.txt/22": "这样啊…………。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_468_axemaster_ev_wanted.txt/0": "哦，赏金会是多少呢？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_find.txt/0": "盾牌真好！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/0": "嗯……还有别的事吗？\r\n想买我的盾吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/1": "那么，祝你武运昌隆。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/2": "嗯……身材不错！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/3": "好久不见，勇者大人。\r\n还记得我吗？\r\n我曾是侍奉康拉斯王的骑士，Grande。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/4": "我是Grande，一名旅行骑士。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/5": "你……看起来不像骑士。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/6": "我有一面多余的盾，\r\n需要的话要买吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/7": "再会吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/8": "你是……哦，原来是骑士啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/9": "我是Grande，一名旅行骑士。\r\n你一路走来，想必很辛苦吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/10": "又见面了，年轻的骑士。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/11": "需要的话，我可以帮你修理盾牌……\r\n不过看样子，\r\n你并不需要。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/12": "既然如此，要不要买一面我的盾？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/13": "再会吧。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/1863": "请帮我修理盾牌。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/1913": "我想买盾。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/1957": "暂时不用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/14": "可以的话，我来稍微修一下你的盾。\r\n你觉得如何？没有盾的话，\r\n也可以买我的。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/15": "再会吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/16": "好，把盾交给我。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/17": "这样……再这样……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/18": "盾牌耐久度恢复了30！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/19": "好，这样应该能撑一阵子。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/20": "那么，再会。\r\n祝你在接下来的战斗中武运昌隆。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_talk.txt/21": "这样啊，再会吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_469_shieldmaster_ev_wanted.txt/0": "我可不想以这种方式\r\n再见面啊……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/0": "哦，要买点什么吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/1": "谢谢！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/2": "现在……是春天吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/3": "我是狙击手，\r\n远程武器就交给我吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/4": "需要远程武器吗？\r\n让我看看吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/5": "谢谢！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/6": "原来如此！\r\n你也很擅长远程武器啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/7": "真让人高兴。\r\n对了！我就用我的技术\r\n帮你强化武器吧！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/8": "你好！\r\n哦，是你啊！\r\n我来帮你强化武器！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/9": "……喂！\r\n你居然没装备武器？！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/10": "外面很危险！\r\n随便买点什么吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/11": "谢谢！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/1609": "拜托了。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/1640": "还是买武器吧。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/1686": "暂时不用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/12": "对了，今天能附加的是……\r\n\\c[52]高价\\c[0]强化，\r\n怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/13": "对了，今天能附加的是……\r\n\\c[52]优质\\c[0]强化，\r\n怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/14": "对了，今天能附加的是……\r\n\\c[52]必中\\c[0]强化，\r\n怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/15": "原来你想要远程武器！\r\n如果你不嫌弃，\r\n就来看看我手上的货吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/16": "那就这样！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/17": "我去了………",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/18": "正装备的武器变强了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/19": "完成了。本来就是把好武器，\r\n现在变得更好了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/20": "那就这样！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_talk.txt/21": "这样啊………。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_470_arrowmaster_ev_wanted.txt/0": "唔！！"
}
